{"id": "EUVD-2026-91135", "enisaUuid": "a2005007-0211-3d91-b904-6d5ba150d56f", "description": "Mooncake transfer engine through 0.3.13.post1 contains a memory exhaustion vulnerability in TransferMetadata::receivePeerNotify that allows unauthenticated attackers to grow process memory without limit. Attackers can repeatedly send notify frames up to 1 MB to the handshake RPC port, filling the uncapped notifys vector until the out-of-memory killer terminates the engine.", "datePublished": "2026-10-01T22:53:06", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-06T02:14:50", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/4445", "https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/blob/719735896c86b56fabec6cf3e825fb2ea640597a/mooncake-transfer-engine/src/transfer_metadata.cpp#L285-L296", "https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mooncake-transfer-engine-through-0.3.13-post1-memory-exhaustion-via-unbounded-notify-queue"], "aliases": ["GHSA-62mv-x7jm-w9f4", "CVE-2026-103761"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.37, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "debc1562-183d-31cc-a7e8-dbb72d9dbd86", "product": {"name": "mooncake", "vendor": {"name": "kvcache-ai"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.3.13.post1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "903dd109-10cb-38d7-b430-640fa73cb058", "vendor": {"name": "kvcache-ai"}}], "isExploited": false}